1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,784
Eh… mana pulak semua apps aku?!

2
00:00:03,584 --> 00:00:04,409
Bayangkan.

3
00:00:04,209 --> 00:00:09,453
Kau baru je bangun pagi… dan semua apps
dalam phone kau, hilang.

4
00:00:09,503 --> 00:00:10,185
Nak chat?

5
00:00:10,464 --> 00:00:11,174
Takde.

6
00:00:11,332 --> 00:00:12,048
Nak bayar?

7
00:00:12,190 --> 00:00:13,031
Takde.

8
00:00:13,188 --> 00:00:14,140
Nak cari jalan?

9
00:00:14,313 --> 00:00:15,189
Pun takde.

10
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:16,426
Semua takde.

11
00:00:16,583 --> 00:00:17,409
Kosong.

12
00:00:21,409 --> 00:00:24,578
Dan bukan phone kau je… satu bandar.

13
00:00:26,778 --> 00:00:30,348
Tapi yang peliknya… phone kau tu masih
hidup.

14
00:00:30,398 --> 00:00:32,649
Sebab apps ni cuma macam kedai.

15
00:00:32,449 --> 00:00:35,444
Yang hidupkan phone kau… ialah OS.

16
00:00:35,244 --> 00:00:37,344
Dia tapak bangunan tu.

17
00:00:37,544 --> 00:00:40,310
Duit dengan akaun kau pun bukan duduk
dalam app.

18
00:00:40,566 --> 00:00:42,644
Semua tu simpan dalam server.

19
00:00:44,044 --> 00:00:48,907
Ohh… jadi kalau aku install balik, login,
semua tu akan

20
00:00:48,707 --> 00:00:49,853
ada balik ke?

21
00:00:49,903 --> 00:00:51,947
Ha ah betul tu...

22
00:00:51,747 --> 00:00:53,312
semua akan ada balik.

23
00:00:53,612 --> 00:00:57,093
So kalau korang, app apa yang korang akan
install dulu?

24
00:00:56,893 --> 00:00:58,611
Cuba komen dekat bawah.
